1
00:04:53,059 --> 00:05:23,039
We'll be right back.

2
00:05:23,059 --> 00:05:53,039
We'll be right back.

3
00:05:53,059 --> 00:06:23,039
We'll be right back.

4
00:06:23,059 --> 00:06:25,819
Almost to Luffy.

5
00:06:26,139 --> 00:06:27,819
Gather at the Courthouse Plaza.

6
00:06:27,819 --> 00:06:57,799
We'll be right back.

7
00:06:57,799 --> 00:07:02,799
What?

8
00:07:03,019 --> 00:07:03,419
No!

9
00:07:03,819 --> 00:07:04,999
Gamora can't see!

10
00:07:05,219 --> 00:07:07,379
His retinas were damaged in that last attack.

11
00:07:07,459 --> 00:07:08,059
He's blind!

12
00:07:11,019 --> 00:07:11,819
What's that?

13
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:12,599
Gamora!

14
00:07:12,799 --> 00:07:13,859
You can't see anything?

15
00:07:17,759 --> 00:07:19,799
It started running like crazy!

16
00:07:19,799 --> 00:07:21,599
Don't just stand there, shoot it!

17
00:07:21,699 --> 00:07:22,919
We gotta stop that thing!

18
00:07:22,979 --> 00:07:24,259
We can't let it go any further!

19
00:07:24,639 --> 00:07:25,879
Fire the transporter!

20
00:07:28,379 --> 00:07:29,779
Gamora, don't do this!

21
00:07:29,859 --> 00:07:30,659
Please stop!

22
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,299
You're in no shape to go on!

23
00:07:32,359 --> 00:07:33,219
You'll kill yourself!

24
00:07:33,219 --> 00:07:39,119
He said that he made a promise to Sodom!

25
00:07:40,919 --> 00:07:44,479
He told Sodom, leave the rest to me!

26
00:07:45,019 --> 00:07:48,819
I'll take on your share and carry everyone the rest of the way!

27
00:07:50,419 --> 00:07:51,099
Gamora!

28
00:07:51,099 --> 00:07:57,519
They were in its stomach?

29
00:07:58,359 --> 00:07:59,519
I'm full already.

30
00:08:00,299 --> 00:08:01,539
Couldn't eat another bite.

31
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,479
Let's take him with us.

32
00:08:03,559 --> 00:08:04,459
It's backup food.

33
00:08:06,459 --> 00:08:07,479
Big bro!

34
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,339
Come here quick!

35
00:08:08,699 --> 00:08:11,299
Some pirates gave Sodom and Gamora a serious beating!

36
00:08:12,099 --> 00:08:14,179
You pirates have got a lot of nerve.

37
00:08:14,299 --> 00:08:15,599
Never touch my family!

38
00:08:21,759 --> 00:08:22,279
Hey!

39
00:08:22,659 --> 00:08:24,119
Take it easy, you two!

40
00:08:24,219 --> 00:08:25,119
You're still injured!

41
00:08:25,499 --> 00:08:27,479
This is no time for a dance party!

42
00:08:27,479 --> 00:08:28,699
Ha ha ha!

43
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:34,759
We're headed straight for a dead end!

44
00:08:34,859 --> 00:08:36,499
He'll crash into it and die!

45
00:08:36,959 --> 00:08:37,479
Gamora!

46
00:08:37,619 --> 00:08:38,239
Stop it!

47
00:08:38,379 --> 00:08:39,579
You'll never make it!

48
00:08:39,819 --> 00:08:40,179
Stop!

49
00:08:41,299 --> 00:08:43,739
A dead end!

50
00:08:44,259 --> 00:08:45,559
I don't see one, do you?

51
00:08:45,819 --> 00:08:46,239
Nope!

52
00:08:47,119 --> 00:08:49,159
Can't say I see anything of the sort!

53
00:08:49,899 --> 00:08:51,839
A dead end!

54
00:09:11,299 --> 00:09:29,579
It's the courthouse!

55
00:09:29,579 --> 00:09:30,859
He did it!

56
00:09:30,859 --> 00:09:31,679
Yeah!

57
00:09:31,679 --> 00:09:37,259
You made it!

58
00:09:37,259 --> 00:09:38,519
Gamora!

59
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:41,739
All units!

60
00:09:41,959 --> 00:09:47,519
The King Bull carrying the pirates broke through Block D and they are now at the courthouse plaza!

61
00:09:48,019 --> 00:09:48,639
I repeat!

62
00:09:48,899 --> 00:09:51,639
The King Bull carrying the pirates broke through!

63
00:09:51,639 --> 00:09:56,019
Look at this, Fogfreed!

64
00:10:00,019 --> 00:10:03,799
A golden transponder snail!

65
00:10:03,799 --> 00:10:13,059
Having this little gadget is the same as having the authority to issue a buster call!

66
00:10:13,059 --> 00:10:18,499
Was someone even higher up than that, Admiral Aokiji entrusted it to me!

67
00:10:18,499 --> 00:10:21,439
The question is if and when will I use it?

68
00:10:21,439 --> 00:10:23,439
Hmm...

69
00:10:23,439 --> 00:10:24,439
Just you wait.

70
00:10:24,439 --> 00:10:25,439
Just you wait.

71
00:10:25,439 --> 00:10:30,439
Once I revive the ancient weapons, this won't just be something that's on loan to me.

72
00:10:30,439 --> 00:10:35,879
I'll carry it of my own accord, along with the power to control an army.

73
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:42,879
I will now initiate a buster call!

74
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:44,879
All ships may commence attack at once!

75
00:10:44,879 --> 00:10:51,099
Target every last thing on this island of archaeology and turn Ohara into ash!

76
00:10:51,099 --> 00:11:00,099
With a single push of a button, an entire island will disappear!

77
00:11:00,099 --> 00:11:03,099
Authority can be a weapon unto itself!

78
00:11:03,099 --> 00:11:04,099
Oh, the power!

79
00:11:04,099 --> 00:11:05,099
Team Spondom!

80
00:11:05,099 --> 00:11:08,099
That was close!

81
00:11:08,099 --> 00:11:10,099
What's wrong with you?

82
00:11:10,099 --> 00:11:12,099
Can't you even knock?

83
00:11:12,099 --> 00:11:14,099
I almost accidentally hit the button!

84
00:11:14,099 --> 00:11:19,099
I'm terribly sorry, sir, but I'm afraid we've got an emergency here.

85
00:11:19,099 --> 00:11:22,099
There's an urgent call from Innie's Lobby's main island!

86
00:11:22,099 --> 00:11:23,099
Idiots!

87
00:11:23,099 --> 00:11:27,099
If there's an emergency, why didn't they just call my room directly?

88
00:11:27,099 --> 00:11:28,099
What the...

89
00:11:28,099 --> 00:11:29,099
Hey!

90
00:11:29,099 --> 00:11:30,099
Why is the receiver off the hook?

91
00:11:30,099 --> 00:11:31,099
This always happens!

92
00:11:31,099 --> 00:11:33,099
Who's responsible?

93
00:11:33,099 --> 00:11:37,099
Well, either way, you were saying something about an emergency, weren't you?

94
00:11:37,099 --> 00:11:38,099
Yes, sir!

95
00:11:38,099 --> 00:11:39,099
Sponda!

96
00:11:55,099 --> 00:11:57,099
Hey, Miss Robin!

97
00:11:57,099 --> 00:12:02,099
It seems we have an urgent report coming in from the marines down at the main island.

98
00:12:02,099 --> 00:12:07,099
Knowing what it's likely about, I wouldn't call it an... emergency, exactly.

99
00:12:07,099 --> 00:12:13,099
Your friends tried their best, but only managed to take down five of our soldiers.

100
00:12:13,099 --> 00:12:16,099
I wonder how they were ultimately defeated.

101
00:12:16,099 --> 00:12:18,099
Did some of my other men bring them down?

102
00:12:18,099 --> 00:12:21,099
Or was it the giant gatekeeping team of Oimo and Kashi?

103
00:12:21,099 --> 00:12:24,099
So many possibilities.

104
00:12:24,099 --> 00:12:29,099
Why don't we listen to the report about those idiots who defied the world government?

105
00:12:29,099 --> 00:12:32,099
And learn their fate together?

106
00:12:32,099 --> 00:12:33,099
You're such a scumbag!

107
00:12:33,099 --> 00:12:35,099
Shut up, you lowlife!

108
00:12:35,099 --> 00:12:40,099
This is Spondum.

109
00:12:40,099 --> 00:12:43,099
I understand you have a report.

110
00:12:43,099 --> 00:12:44,099
Chief Spondum!

111
00:12:44,099 --> 00:12:45,099
Finally!

112
00:12:45,099 --> 00:12:46,099
Thank goodness!

113
00:12:46,099 --> 00:12:48,099
I tried your direct line, but I couldn't get through.

114
00:12:48,099 --> 00:12:49,099
I'm...

115
00:12:49,099 --> 00:12:50,099
I'm not really sure where to begin.

116
00:12:52,099 --> 00:12:53,099
Calm down.

117
00:12:53,099 --> 00:12:54,099
Take it easy.

118
00:12:54,099 --> 00:12:55,099
It's the Straw Hats, right?

119
00:12:55,099 --> 00:12:56,099
Yes.

120
00:12:56,099 --> 00:12:57,099
What about them?

121
00:12:57,099 --> 00:12:58,099
Whoa.

122
00:12:58,099 --> 00:12:59,099
Hold on.

123
00:12:59,099 --> 00:13:00,099
Listen.

124
00:13:00,099 --> 00:13:02,099
Take up from where your last report ended.

125
00:13:02,099 --> 00:13:05,099
Give me the gritty details, loudly and clearly.

126
00:13:05,099 --> 00:13:06,099
Right.

127
00:13:06,099 --> 00:13:07,099
The intruders...

128
00:13:07,099 --> 00:13:08,099
Did you accidentally kill them?

129
00:13:08,099 --> 00:13:09,099
Pity.

130
00:13:09,099 --> 00:13:10,099
It's their fault for being such weaklings.

131
00:13:10,099 --> 00:13:13,099
The intruders consist of about 60 pirates.

132
00:13:13,099 --> 00:13:18,099
They've pushed their way all the way through the main island and have reached the courthouse plaza.

133
00:13:18,099 --> 00:13:20,099
We can't stop them, sir!

134
00:13:20,099 --> 00:13:33,099
All personnel on any slobby's main island, head to the courthouse plaza immediately!

135
00:13:33,099 --> 00:13:36,099
You did a good job, Gamora.

136
00:13:36,099 --> 00:13:41,099
I swear everything you two did will not be in vain.

137
00:13:41,099 --> 00:13:44,099
All right, we're breaking in!

138
00:13:44,099 --> 00:13:47,099
It's time to say big bro breaking!

139
00:13:47,099 --> 00:13:50,099
Yeah!

140
00:13:50,099 --> 00:13:51,099
I repeat!

141
00:13:51,099 --> 00:13:54,099
The pirates have reached the courthouse plaza!

142
00:14:11,099 --> 00:14:30,099
Can you see Luffy?

143
00:14:30,099 --> 00:14:31,099
Nope.

144
00:14:31,099 --> 00:14:41,099
But whether he's up on the roof or not, it's not exactly like we can just jump up after him.

145
00:14:41,099 --> 00:14:42,099
That's true.

146
00:14:42,099 --> 00:14:44,099
How much we can do.

147
00:14:44,099 --> 00:14:47,099
How many members of CP9 did you see up there?

148
00:14:47,099 --> 00:14:50,099
It was just that one big guy with the bullhorns.

149
00:14:50,099 --> 00:14:56,099
It's hard to believe that Robin, Frankie, all of them are right behind those doors.

150
00:14:56,099 --> 00:15:00,099
In any case, we need to catch up with Luffy.

151
00:15:00,099 --> 00:15:02,099
Then we can save Robin together!

152
00:15:02,099 --> 00:15:03,099
Hurry!

153
00:15:03,099 --> 00:15:04,099
Get to the courthouse!

154
00:15:04,099 --> 00:15:06,099
The drawbridge isn't down yet!

155
00:15:06,099 --> 00:15:07,099
Corner them!

156
00:15:26,099 --> 00:15:27,099
Whoa!

157
00:15:27,099 --> 00:15:28,099
That frog's awesome!

158
00:15:28,099 --> 00:15:29,099
That's the same bow that took out Gamora!

159
00:15:29,099 --> 00:15:30,099
Who threw it?

160
00:15:30,099 --> 00:15:31,099
Whoa!

161
00:15:31,099 --> 00:15:32,099
There's three of them!

162
00:15:32,099 --> 00:15:33,099
And they're running away!

163
00:15:33,099 --> 00:15:34,099
Why are they running away?

164
00:15:34,099 --> 00:15:35,099
They're the ones that attacked first!

165
00:15:35,099 --> 00:15:36,099
Idiot cook!

166
00:15:36,099 --> 00:15:37,099
We can't go around chasing every enemy that runs off like that!

167
00:15:37,099 --> 00:15:50,099
It's a waste of time!

168
00:15:50,099 --> 00:16:08,099
Oh, pipe down!

169
00:16:08,099 --> 00:16:11,099
It's confirmation!

170
00:16:11,099 --> 00:16:14,099
Some of them need to be chased, understand?

171
00:16:14,099 --> 00:16:15,099
To find out who we're up against.

172
00:16:15,099 --> 00:16:16,299
Whoa!

173
00:16:18,099 --> 00:16:19,099
Where's this guy?

174
00:16:19,099 --> 00:16:22,839
He must have superhuman strength to swing something like that around.

175
00:16:23,139 --> 00:16:26,139
You think he's part of some special unit, like those guard dogs?

176
00:16:26,479 --> 00:16:28,839
There are probably more of them hiding out there somewhere.

177
00:16:29,559 --> 00:16:30,459
Let's be careful.

178
00:16:33,439 --> 00:16:34,839
We need to get moving.

179
00:16:35,079 --> 00:16:37,099
It looks like the reinforcements have arrived.

180
00:16:37,419 --> 00:16:38,139
Surround them!

181
00:16:38,239 --> 00:16:40,859
There's no way they'll be able to open those heavy stone doors!

182
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:42,919
We'll have them cornered! Move it!

183
00:16:43,739 --> 00:16:44,719
He's right.

184
00:16:45,039 --> 00:16:46,919
Now that I think about it, how...

185
00:16:49,099 --> 00:16:54,079
Are we gonna open those big stones?

186
00:16:56,479 --> 00:16:59,659
We're going in first! Stay close! Don't fall behind!

187
00:16:59,899 --> 00:17:03,459
He... he cut right through them! Like it was nothing!

188
00:17:03,719 --> 00:17:06,019
Hey, Zombai! Let's split up!

189
00:17:06,359 --> 00:17:08,079
We need to charge both of those towers!

190
00:17:08,099 --> 00:17:10,779
Because each side has a lever to open up that drawbridge!

191
00:17:10,939 --> 00:17:13,299
Yeah! Good thinking! I'm on it!

192
00:17:13,719 --> 00:17:16,659
Right! Looks like we need to split into three teams!

193
00:17:16,659 --> 00:17:19,619
Most of you go with Kiwi and Mozu, the rest are with me!

194
00:17:19,779 --> 00:17:21,559
We'll crack some heads in that courthouse!

195
00:17:22,019 --> 00:17:22,979
Good luck, everyone!

196
00:17:23,619 --> 00:17:24,119
Move!

197
00:17:24,119 --> 00:17:43,859
Also, the gatekeepers of the main island front gate, Oimo and Kashi, have joined up with the pirates!

198
00:17:43,859 --> 00:17:46,859
They're currently destroying the central part of the main island!

199
00:17:46,859 --> 00:17:49,559
We are the way!

200
00:17:49,559 --> 00:17:52,999
We are the way!

201
00:21:55,180 --> 00:22:25,160
We'll see you next time.

202
00:22:25,180 --> 00:22:54,700
You know, truth is, I'm glad I met you guys when I did.

203
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:56,480
And why is that?

204
00:22:56,620 --> 00:22:59,860
Because thanks to you, I won't ever lose my friends.

205
00:23:00,260 --> 00:23:02,900
Ridiculous. You certainly are full of hot air.

206
00:23:03,120 --> 00:23:04,460
Now, gum gum!

207
00:23:05,140 --> 00:23:08,840
On the next, One Piece, everything is to protect my friends.

208
00:23:09,100 --> 00:23:10,540
Second gear activated.

209
00:23:10,540 --> 00:23:12,540
I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

